## Step 3: Zero-Diff State Migration

### Identify Old Resource Paths

Before refactoring, run:

```bash
terraform plan  # Review what would change
```

### Create Migration Script

Create `migrate_state.sh`:

```bash
#!/bin/bash

# Mapping: terraform state mv <old-path> <new-path>

# Dev environment
terraform state mv aws_eks_cluster.dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_eks_cluster.main
terraform state mv aws_eks_node_group.dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_eks_node_group.main
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket.dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_s3_bucket.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket_versioning.dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_s3_bucket_versioning.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_db_instance.dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_db_instance.postgres
terraform state mv random_password.db_password_dev module.app_environment["dev"].random_password.db_password
terraform state mv aws_secretsmanager_secret.db_connection_dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_secretsmanager_secret.db_connection
terraform state mv aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db_connection_dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db_connection
terraform state mv aws_iam_user.service_account_dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_iam_user.service_account
terraform state mv aws_iam_role.service_account_dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_iam_role.service_account
terraform state mv aws_iam_role_policy.service_account_dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_iam_role_policy.service_account
terraform state mv aws_lb.app_dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_lb.app[0]
terraform state mv aws_lb_listener.app_https_dev module.app_environment["dev"].aws_lb_listener.app_https[0]

# Prod environment
terraform state mv aws_eks_cluster.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_eks_cluster.main
terraform state mv aws_eks_node_group.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_eks_node_group.main
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_s3_bucket.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket_versioning.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_s3_bucket_versioning.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.app_assets
terraform state mv aws_s3_bucket_replication_configuration.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_s3_bucket_replication_configuration.app_assets[0]
terraform state mv aws_db_instance.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_db_instance.postgres
terraform state mv random_password.db_password_prod module.app_environment["prod"].random_password.db_password
terraform state mv aws_secretsmanager_secret.db_connection_prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_secretsmanager_secret.db_connection
terraform state mv aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db_connection_prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db_connection
terraform state mv aws_iam_user.service_account_prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_iam_user.service_account
terraform state mv aws_iam_role.service_account_prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_iam_role.service_account
terraform state mv aws_iam_role_policy.service_account_prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_iam_role_policy.service_account
terraform state mv aws_cloudfront_distribution.app_prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_cloudfront_distribution.app[0]
terraform state mv aws_kms_key.prod module.app_environment["prod"].aws_kms_key.prod

echo "State migration complete. Run 'terraform plan' to verify zero-diff."
```

### Execute Migration

```bash
chmod +x migrate_state.sh
./migrate_state.sh
terraform plan  # Should show zero changes
```

